   "change": "Validated against 25 press-cited Asheville dishes; fixed four real bugs. (1) Spanish, Italian and Amharic coverage added -- 'pan con tomate', 'ropa vieja', 'misir', 'gomen', 'tikil gomen' all previously invisible, which systematically undercounted exactly the restaurants with the least English-legible menus. (2) compound-word matching added: 'shrimpburger' matched nothing. (3) 'pie' and pastry terms added to wheat_grain. (4) 'gravy' added -- a flour-and-dairy thickener that named nothing."
